.TH KUGELMATCH 6 "2026" "KugelMatch" "Games"
.SH NAME
kugelmatch \- raytraced Pong (CPU and GPU fragment-shader backends)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kugelmatch
[\fB\-\-cpu\fR|\fB\-\-gpu\fR]
.br
.B kugelmatch
[\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B KugelMatch
is a classic Pong-style game rendered with full analytic ray tracing.
Two backends share the same scene and rules:
.TP
.B \-\-cpu
Multi-threaded software raytracer (SDL2 texture upload). This is the default.
.TP
.B \-\-gpu
OpenGL fragment-shader raytracer (fullscreen triangle, no scene meshes).
.PP
The look is intentionally 1990s: checkerboard floor and walls, a reflective
mirror ball, and a camera attached to the near paddle looking down the court.
.SH OPTIONS
Command-line options override the config file. Common flags:
.TP
.B \-\-cpu / \-\-gpu
Select the software or GPU raytracer backend.
.TP
.B \-\-fullscreen / \-\-windowed
Display mode.
.TP
.B \-\-quality low|medium|high|ultra
Quality preset (bounces, shadows, scale).
.TP
.B \-\-scale F, \-\-vsync / \-\-no-vsync, \-\-fps N
Render scale and frame pacing.
.TP
.B \-\-1p / \-\-2p, \-\-difficulty, \-\-points, \-\-camera, \-\-theme
Match options.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Print full help and exit.
.SH CONTROLS
.SS Match flow
.TP
.B Space / Enter
Start a match, skip intro, skip goal replay, or rematch after game over.
.TP
.B P
Pause / resume.
.TP
.B R
Restart the match.
.TP
.B Esc
Pause, then attract mode, then quit.
.TP
.B F8
Switch CPU ↔ GPU.
.TP
.B F9
Toggle slow-motion goal replay.
.TP
.B Q / F10
Cycle quality preset (Low → Medium → High → Ultra).
.TP
.B F11 / Alt+Enter
Toggle fullscreen.
.TP
.B F12
Save a screenshot as a BMP file (to ~/Pictures if it exists, otherwise the current directory).
.SS Play
.TP
.B A / D
Move the near paddle (also arrow keys in 1P mode).
.TP
.B Gamepad
Left stick or D-pad moves P1; second controller (or right stick in 2P) moves P2. A / Start confirms; B / Back pauses or backs out; Y toggles two-player.
.TP
.B Arrow keys
Far paddle in 2P mode.
.SS Options
.TP
.B 1
Difficulty: Easy → Normal → Hard.
.TP
.B 2
Points to win: 7 / 11 / 15 / 21.
.TP
.B 3
Camera: Paddle / High / Sideline.
.TP
.B 4
Toggle 1P / 2P.
.TP
.B 5
Reflection bounces 0–3.
.TP
.B 6
Vsync on/off.
.TP
.B 7
Soft-shadow samples 1 / 2 / 4 / 8.
.TP
.B 8 / 9
Hold to lower / raise exposure ([ and ] also work).
.TP
.B 0
Theme: Classic / Neon / Ice / Ember.
.TP
.B M
Mute.
.TP
.B + / −
Volume.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/kugelmatch/config.cfg
Persisted settings (XDG config home).
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_DIRS/kugelmatch/shaders/
Optional GLSL sources when not using the embedded shader.
